#: ../../corporate.rst:1
msgid "Corporate and global programs"
msgstr "企业创新与全球项目"

#: ../../corporate.rst:4
msgid ""
"13 profiles with evidence, contact routes and an application checklist. "
"Published existence is distinguished from current intake."
msgstr "收录13家机构，附资料来源、联系方式和申请参考。机构信息已核实，不代表当前正在接受申请。"

#: ../../corporate.rst:6
msgid ""
"Global programs are kept separate from local offices. Their China-region "
"eligibility, service availability and account rules require direct "
"verification. Historical corporate cohorts are marked."
msgstr "全球项目与上海本地办公机构分别说明。中国区的申请条件、服务范围及账户规则，应向运营方确认；历史批次另作标注。"

#: ../../corporate.rst:10
msgid "Complete directory summary"
msgstr "机构目录概览"

#: ../../corporate.rst:13
msgid ""
":doc:`Roche Accelerator <entities/roche>` (罗氏加速器 · Corporate program · "
"Pudong · Focus: Health, AI for Science) — Roche describes its Shanghai "
"innovation accelerator for the China ecosystem. Relevant to healthcare "
"and AI-enabled discovery teams. Scientific fit, space, collaboration, "
"funding and IP terms are distinct questions. [Status: Published entity; "
"intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`罗氏加速器 <entities/roche>` （企业创新计划 · 浦东新区 · 方向：健康、科学智能）：罗氏在上海设立、面向中国创新生态的加速器，医疗健康及AI研发团队可了解相关资源。科研匹配、空间、合作、资金和知识产权需分别确认。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:14
msgid ""
":doc:`SAP.iO Foundry Shanghai <entities/sapio>` (SAP.iO上海加速器 · Corporate "
"program · Pudong · Focus: Software AI, Industry) — The 2021 launch "
"described an equity-free intelligent-manufacturing accelerator. It is "
"included as a historical corporate route; the source does not establish a "
"2026 Shanghai intake. Support: Equity-free services. [Status: Historical "
"/ confirm continuation]"
msgstr ":doc:`SAP.iO上海加速器 <entities/sapio>` （企业创新计划 · 浦东新区 · 方向：AI软件、产业）：2021年启动公告介绍了不要求出让股权的智能制造加速项目。本条保留为历史企业合作信息，不能据此判断2026年上海仍在征集项目。 支持方式：无需出让股权的服务支持。【状态：历史项目，是否延续需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:15
msgid ""
":doc:`ABB open innovation / Shanghai robotics <entities/abb>` "
"(ABB开放创新／上海机器人生态 · Corporate program · Pudong · Focus: Hardware AI, "
"Robotics) — ABB publishes open-innovation and startup collaboration "
"routes. Its May 2025 Shanghai AI event is evidence of ecosystem activity, "
"not an always-open startup accelerator cohort. Propose a measurable "
"robotics use case. [Status: Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`ABB开放创新／上海机器人生态 <entities/abb>` （企业创新计划 · 浦东新区 · 方向：AI硬件、机器人）：ABB公布了开放创新及初创企业合作渠道。2025年5月上海AI活动可确认相关活动曾开展，但不代表设有长期开放的加速营。机器人团队可提交目标明确、可量化的应用方案。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`DroidUp Ecosystem Accelerator <entities/droidup>` (卓益得生态加速器 · "
"Corporate program · Pudong · Focus: Hardware AI, Robotics) — The December "
"2025 Zhangjiang Robot Valley account reports the accelerator launch. We "
"include it as a robotics industry route and require direct confirmation "
"of intake, pilot access, investment and hardware resources. [Status: "
"Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`卓益得生态加速器 <entities/droidup>` （企业创新计划 · 浦东新区 · 方向：AI硬件、机器人）：2025年12月张江机器人谷报道记录了该加速器的启动。机器人团队可据此寻找产业合作，但当前项目征集、试点、投资和硬件资源均需向运营方确认。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:17
msgid ""
":doc:`Shanghai AI Public Technology Service Platform <entities/paddle>` "
"(上海人工智能公共技术服务平台 · Corporate program · Pudong · Focus: Software AI) — The "
"PaddlePaddle-linked platform publishes AI training and ecosystem "
"resources. Explore its technical services and developer events; confirm "
"whether a specific training or compute offer carries fees. [Status: "
"Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`上海人工智能公共技术服务平台 <entities/paddle>` （企业创新计划 · 浦东新区 · 方向：AI软件）：飞桨相关平台提供AI培训及开发者生态资源，可咨询技术服务和活动安排。具体培训或算力服务是否收费，需单独确认。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:18
msgid ""
":doc:`Yangtze River Delta AI+ Joint Innovation Center "
"<entities/huawei-ai>` (长三角AI+联合创新中心 · Corporate program · Qingpu · Focus: "
"Software AI, Hardware AI) — An official July 2026 account records the "
"center beginning operations in Qingpu. Confirm the operator, technical "
"scope, Huawei ecosystem interface and actual startup admission before "
"describing a benefit package. [Status: Published entity; intake to "
"confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`长三角AI+联合创新中心 <entities/huawei-ai>` （企业创新计划 · 青浦区 · 方向：AI软件、AI硬件）：2026年7月官方报道记录该中心在青浦投入运营。申请前应确认运营主体、技术服务范围、华为生态对接方式及初创企业准入条件，不能自行推定可获得哪些资源。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:19
msgid ""
":doc:`NVIDIA Inception <entities/nvidia>` (英伟达初创加速计划 · Global program · "
"Citywide / global · Focus: Software AI, Hardware AI) — A free AI startup "
"ecosystem program with no application fee, membership fee or equity "
"requirement. It is not a cash grant. China eligibility, product access "
"and partner benefits must be checked for the specific company. Support: "
"Equity-free services. [Status: Program published; eligibility review]"
msgstr ":doc:`英伟达初创加速计划 <entities/nvidia>` （全球计划 · 全市／全球 · 方向：AI软件、AI硬件）：面向AI初创企业的生态计划，不收申请费、会员费，也不要求出让股权，但不提供通用现金补助。企业需确认中国区资格、产品供应及合作伙伴权益。 支持方式：无需出让股权的服务支持。【状态：已公布，需审核申请资格】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:20
msgid ""
":doc:`Microsoft for Startups <entities/ms-startups>` (微软初创企业计划 · Global "
"program · Citywide / global · Focus: Software AI) — The current program "
"provides Azure-related startup resources through online application. We "
"do not transfer historic Shanghai accelerator terms or global credit "
"ceilings to China-region accounts. Validate the legal entity and region "
"first. Support: Cloud credits. [Status: Regional eligibility to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`微软初创企业计划 <entities/ms-startups>` （全球计划 · 全市／全球 · 方向：AI软件）：通过在线申请提供Azure等创业资源。中国区企业和账户的适用条件需单独确认，不能沿用历史上海加速器条款或直接套用全球服务额度上限。 支持方式：云服务额度。【状态：地区适用条件需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:21
msgid ""
":doc:`AWS China Activate <entities/aws-activate>` (亚马逊云科技中国区Activate · "
"Global program · Citywide / global · Focus: Software AI) — A China-region "
"startup offer with company, customer and participating investor or "
"incubation relationship conditions. Credits offset eligible services; "
"they are not cash and should not be confused with the separate global AWS "
"offer. Support: Cloud credits. [Status: Regional eligibility to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`亚马逊云科技中国区Activate <entities/aws-activate>` （全球计划 · 全市／全球 · 方向：AI软件）：中国区初创企业支持计划，对企业、新客户身份及投资机构或孵化合作关系设有条件。服务额度只能抵扣规定的云服务，不能兑换现金，也不能直接套用全球AWS规则。 支持方式：云服务额度。【状态：地区适用条件需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`JLABS Shanghai <entities/jlabs>` (强生创新JLABS上海 · Corporate program · "
"Pudong · Focus: Health, AI for Science) — An operator-listed "
"life-sciences incubation site in Zhangjiang with an application route. "
"For AI-enabled healthcare, clarify scientific fit, laboratory "
"requirements, residency pricing, IP and any separate challenge or "
"investment terms. [Status: Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`强生创新JLABS上海 <entities/jlabs>` （企业创新计划 · 浦东新区 · 方向：健康、科学智能）：运营方公布的张江生命科学孵化基地，设有申请渠道。AI医疗团队应确认研究方向、实验需求、入驻费用和知识产权安排；挑战赛或投资项目另有条件。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Bayer Co.Lab Shanghai <entities/bayer>` (拜耳Co.Lab上海 · Corporate "
"program · Pudong · Focus: Health, AI for Science) — Bayer's September "
"2024 Shanghai site launch describes shared laboratories and office space "
"for early biotech teams in SH-INNO Park. Confirm available residency and "
"collaboration terms; the historic capacity is not a current vacancy "
"count. [Status: Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`拜耳Co.Lab上海 <entities/bayer>` （企业创新计划 · 浦东新区 · 方向：健康、科学智能）：拜耳2024年9月启动资料介绍了SH-INNO园区内面向早期生物科技团队的共享实验室及办公场地。当前入驻与合作条款需进一步确认，历史公布容量不代表实时空位。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:24
msgid ""
":doc:`Siemens startup / Xcelerator ecosystem <entities/siemens>` "
"(西门子初创企业与Xcelerator生态 · Global program · Citywide / global · Focus: "
"Software AI, Hardware AI, Industry) — Siemens publishes a startup "
"connection and marketplace route for industrial solutions, with a "
"separate China Xcelerator platform. Marketplace onboarding and industrial "
"partnerships are distinct from a funding award. [Status: Published "
"entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`西门子初创企业与Xcelerator生态 <entities/siemens>` （全球计划 · 全市／全球 · 方向：AI软件、AI硬件、产业）：西门子提供工业解决方案相关的初创企业合作及市场平台，中国另设Xcelerator平台。平台入驻、产业合作与资金资助是不同事项。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../corporate.rst:25
msgid ""
":doc:`BMW Group Startup Garage <entities/bmw>` (宝马集团Startup Garage · "
"Global program · Citywide / global · Focus: Mobility, Hardware AI, "
"Software AI) — BMW describes a venture-client route for evaluating "
"startup solutions for products, services and internal processes. Validate "
"the responsible China business owner and pilot requirements; "
"venture-client activity is not necessarily equity investment. [Status: "
"Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`宝马集团Startup Garage <entities/bmw>` （全球计划 · 全市／全球 · 方向：交通、AI硬件、AI软件）：宝马通过“风险客户”（venture client）模式，评估初创企业的产品、服务及内部流程解决方案。需确认中国业务对接人及试点要求；作为早期客户开展合作，并不一定涉及股权投资。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"
